TRANSLATIONS
============

If you want to contribute by translating the program to any language, add
your language code to the file 'po/LINGUAS'. Then, after 'meson setup build',
state

	ninja -C build wavelet-denoise-pot wavelet-denoise-update-po

which will create or update the file 'po/<your language>.po'.

Translate this file and send it to the program maintainer. Thank you!
